{"4757610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trebuchet Simulator", "steam_appid": 4757610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4758010], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trebuchet Simulator</strong> is a physics simulation game where you control a massive siege engine that fires a metal ball. Adjust your mechanical parameters to launch devastating projectiles and destroy the enemy castle to win.<br><br>To breach these fortresses, you’ll need to master the math of momentum. Keep a close eye on the castle's life bar, step up to the configuration panel, and calibrate your machine to deliver maximum kinetic devastation. Will your projectile soar gracefully over the battlements, or will a poorly calculated arm send your metal ball crashing into the dirt? The math is in your hands.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Physics Customization:</strong> Fine-tune the anatomy of your trebuchet. Adjust the length of the long arm, short arm, sling, weight arm, and the overall height of the pivot.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4757610/extras/f955be29998a2c4b362120a7674007b2.poster.avif?t=1780030006\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4757610/extras/f955be29998a2c4b362120a7674007b2.webm?t=1780030006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4757610/extras/f955be29998a2c4b362120a7674007b2.mp4?t=1780030006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mass &amp; Trajectory Tuning:</strong> Balance the heavy counterweight mass against your metal projectile's mass, then dial in the base angle and release angle to find the perfect destructive arc.<br><spa